msgid "MySQL server executable not tested."
msgstr "O executábel do servidor MySQL non está probado."

#: selftestdialog.cpp:181 selftestdialog.cpp:220 selftestdialog.cpp:269
msgid "The current configuration does not require an internal MySQL server."
msgstr "A configuración actual non requere dun servidor MySQL interno."

#: selftestdialog.cpp:188
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You currently have configured Akonadi to use the MySQL server '%1'.\n"
"Make sure you have the MySQL server installed, set the correct path and "
"ensure you have the necessary read and execution rights on the server "
"executable. The server executable is typically called 'mysqld', its "
"locations varies depending on the distribution."
msgstr ""
"Ten a Akonadi configurado para empregar o servidor MySQL \"%1\".\n"
"Verifique que ten o servidor MySQL instalado, configurada a rota correcta e "
"que ten os permisos correctos de leitura e execución do executábel do "
"servidor. Normalmente, o executábel do servidor chámase \"mysqld\", e onde "
"está depende da distribución."

